{"id":"d1a93f161909f5aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Hereditary Name","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name — ZFC Forcing3 Hereditary Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name — ZFC Forcing3 Hereditary Name","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name — ZFC Forcing3 Hereditary Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\dot x\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\dot x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S(\\mathbb P,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S(\\mathbb P,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate is recursive: every entry is a pair of a lower-rank <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>-name and a condition, so heredity is already enforced at every depth.</li>\n<li>A raw condition such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tc}(\\dot x)\\subseteq V^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\">\\(\\operatorname{tc}(\\dot x)\\subseteq V^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\\)</span> is ill-typed because the transitive closure also contains the set components of ordered-pair codes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e84e795929a8b98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e84e795929a8b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-name.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\dot x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3HereditaryName}_S(\\mathbb P,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tc}(\\dot x)\\subseteq V^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P","display":false}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2076","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-hereditary-name]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["4e84e795929a8b98"]}